      "rawToolArgs": "{\"comparisons\":[{\"requirementIndex\":0,\"lemmaName\":\"dog_kennels__q000__original__none\",\"match\":true,\"discrepancy\":\"\",\"weakeningType\":\"none\",\"explanation\":\"The query correctly counts professionals who have never performed any treatments by checking if their professional_id does not appear in the Treatments table. This directly matches the requirement.\"},{\"requirementIndex\":1,\"lemmaName\":\"dog_kennels__q475__control__commute_eq\",\"match\":false,\"discrepancy\":\"The requirement asks for the owner of the YOUNGEST dog, but the query finds owners whose dogs have the MAXIMUM age. This is the opposite of what was requested.\",\"weakeningType\":\"wrong-property\",\"explanation\":\"The query uses MAX(age) instead of MIN(age). The requirement specifically asks for the youngest dog, but the query returns the oldest.\"},{\"requirementIndex\":2,\"lemmaName\":\"dog_kennels__q692__semantic__bump_limit\",\"match\":false,\"discrepancy\":\"The requirement asks for the owner who paid the largest amount in total, but the query returns the top 2 owners (LIMIT 2) instead of just 1. This returns more results than requested.\",\"weakeningType\":\"weakened-postcondition\",\"explanation\":\"The query uses LIMIT 2 instead of LIMIT 1, returning the top 2 owners by total treatment cost rather than just the single owner who spent the most.\"},{\"requirementIndex\":3,\"lemmaName\":\"dog_kennels__q506__semantic__swap_aggregate\",\"match\":true,\"discrepancy\":\"\",\"weakeningType\":\"none\",\"explanation\":\"The query correctly finds owners whose dogs have the minimum age (youngest dog) and returns their last names. This matches the requirement.\"},{\"requirementIndex\":4,\"lemmaName\":\"dog_kennels__q1256__control__count_star_to_one\",\"match\":true,\"discrepancy\":\"\",\"weakeningType\":\"none\",\"explanation\":\"The query correctly counts dogs whose age is less than the average age. This directly matches the requirement.\"},{\"requirementIndex\":5